          "prompt": "# 农场运营规划任务 Prompt\n\n你是一名农场经营规划 AI。请只依据输入任务中的 `available_crops` 和作物基础信息制定计划，在任务持续天数内最大化最终现金盈利。\n\n## 输入模板\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"farm-example\",\n  \"difficulty\": 2,\n  \"initial_money\": 200,\n  \"farmland_count\": 12,\n  \"duration_days\": 12,\n  \"available_crops\": [\"wheat\", \"corn\"],\n  \"crop_catalog\": {\n    \"wheat\": {\"id\": \"wheat\", \"name\": \"小麦\", \"seed_price\": 20, \"maturity_days\": 2, \"yield_per_harvest\": 3, \"fruit_price\": 12},\n    \"corn\": {\"id\": \"corn\", \"name\": \"玉米\", \"seed_price\": 35, \"maturity_days\": 3, \"yield_per_harvest\": 4, \"fruit_price\": 16}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n规则：第 `day` 天购买的种子才可在当天或之后种植；收获日为种植日加 `maturity_days`；每天操作顺序为购买、种植、收获、出售；农田在收获前持续占用；未出售果实和剩余种子不计入盈利；不能透支资金、种植未知作物或出售未收获果实。\n\n任务 JSON 中只包含制定计划所需的规则、资金、农田和作物信息；请最大化实际模拟利润。\n\n## 输出模板\n\n只输出合法 JSON，不要添加 Markdown 围栏或解释文字：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"farm-example\",\n  \"days\": [\n    {\n      \"day\": 1,\n      \"buy_seeds\": [{\"crop\": \"wheat\", \"quantity\": 4}],\n      \"plant\": [{\"crop\": \"wheat\", \"quantity\": 4}],\n      \"harvest\": [],\n      \"sell\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"day\": 3,\n      \"buy_seeds\": [],\n      \"plant\": [],\n      \"harvest\": [{\"crop\": \"wheat\", \"quantity\": 4}],\n      \"sell\": [{\"crop\": \"wheat\", \"quantity\": 12}]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n可以省略没有操作的日期；每个日期最多出现一次。所有数量必须是正整数。目标是最大化模拟器返回的 `profit`。\n\n## Current task\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"farm-d1-02\",\n  \"difficulty\": 1,\n  \"initial_money\": 200,\n  \"farmland_count\": 8,\n  \"duration_days\": 8,\n  \"available_crops\": [\n    \"blue_jazz\",\n    \"carrot\",\n    \"tulip\",\n    \"unmilled_rice\"\n  ],\n  \"crop_catalog\": {\n    \"blue_jazz\": {\n      \"id\": \"blue_jazz\",\n      \"name\": \"蓝爵\",\n      \"seed_price\": 30,\n      \"maturity_days\": 7,\n      \"yield_per_harvest\": 2,\n      \"fruit_price\": 40\n    },\n    \"carrot\": {\n      \"id\": \"carrot\",\n      \"name\": \"胡萝卜\",\n      \"seed_price\": 20,\n      \"maturity_days\": 3,\n      \"yield_per_harvest\": 1,\n      \"fruit_price\": 35\n    },\n    \"tulip\": {\n      \"id\": \"tulip\",\n      \"name\": \"郁金香\",\n      \"seed_price\": 20,\n      \"maturity_days\": 6,\n      \"yield_per_harvest\": 2,\n      \"fruit_price\": 30\n    },\n    \"unmilled_rice\": {\n      \"id\": \"unmilled_rice\",\n      \"name\": \"未碾米\",\n      \"seed_price\": 40,\n      \"maturity_days\": 8,\n      \"yield_per_harvest\": 10,\n      \"fruit_price\": 10\n    }\n  },\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"day_numbering\": \"1-based\",\n    \"daily_operation_order\": [\n      \"buy_seeds\",\n      \"plant\",\n      \"harvest\",\n      \"sell\"\n    ],\n    \"harvest_day\": \"plant_day + maturity_days\",\n    \"unsold_fruit_has_no_value\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThis is a non-interactive API call. Do not inspect files, use tools, or write explanations. Compute the plan directly and return only the plan JSON object as specified above.\n",
